_awardTab__yaTHJ\" style=\"display:;\">\n          Giải thưởng\n      </li> <li aria-label=\"ROG Thor 1000W Platinum III Video review\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"tabpanel-video\" id=\"Video_review\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ\" style=\"display:;\">\n          Video review\n      </li> <li aria-label=\"ROG Thor 1000W Platinum III Media review\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"tabpanel-media\" id=\"Media_review\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ\" style=\"display:;\">\n          Media review\n      </li></ul></div> <div id=\"tabpanel-awards\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"Giải_thưởng\"><div class=\"ProductAward__productAwardPagePadding__dSaZj\"><div class=\"ProductAward__awardTitle__GUset\"><h2 class=\"pageAward vnRogFont ProductAward__vnRogFontSize__5eSiT\">\n        Giải thưởng \n      </h2> <span>(3)</span></div> <div class=\"ProductAward__mobileAwardContent__LNDCh\"><ul class=\"ProductAward__rewardContainer__sHbkR ProductAward__rewardItemLessThanThree__qeW8A\" style=\"width:100%;\"><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1263/202101131823581820714.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Performance Award\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      GinjFo\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Performance Award</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      With this ROG Thor 1000W Platinum III, Asus confirms its expertise in high-end power supplies. This third iteration is designed for the most demanding configurations. With its sleek design, meticulous finish and advanced functionality, this power supply is made for the elite of gaming, where performance and silence go hand in hand without compromise.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>FRANCE</span> <span>03/28/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Thor 1000W Platinum III Media review Award of Performance Award\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.ginjfo.com/dossiers/tests-materiel/composants/alimentations/test-rog-thor-1000w-platinum-iii-dasus-20250328\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1252/201911212011036520861.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"DDs Recommended\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      www.ddworld.cz\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>DDs Recommended</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      And it is good that, at the same time, it is an overall high-quality power supply with excellent operating characteristics on top of that very striking extra look. So even its price is simply, let's say, more striking and truly something extra. And that is exactly what the ASUS ROG Thor Platinum III series is in the field of computer power supplies = something more striking and something extra for your PC ;)\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>CZECH REPUBLIC</span> <span>12/22/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Thor 1000W Platinum III Media review Award of DDs Recommended\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"http://www.ddworld.cz/pc-a-komponenty/case-a-zdroje/asus-rog-thor-1000w-platinum-iii-atx-v3.1-test-a-recenze-poradneho-extra-nacancaneho-zdroje--4.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1265/202608101626334330173.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"igor's Lab: 4,5/5\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      igorslab.de\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>igor's Lab: 4,5/5</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The ASUS ROG Thor 1000W Platinum III Gaming is a very powerful premium power supply\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>GERMANY</span> <span>08/04/2026</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Thor 1000W Platinum III Media review Award of igor's Lab: 4,5/5\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.igorslab.de/rog-thor-1000w-platinum-iii-gaming-im-test-viel-leistung-und-show-fuer-marken-affine-enthusiasten/ https://www.igorslab.de/en/rog-thor-1000w-platinum-iii-gaming-review-plenty-of-power-and-show-for-brand-affine-enthusiasts/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" 