__b+fib AwardVideoContent__reviewType__isoMH\"><p class=\"AwardVideoContent__actionTitle__9KMXz\">Honestly guys, they've done something crazy... they changed everything... the PC is insane guys, I'm shocked, they guys are going to lose their minds.</p></div></li></ul></div> <ul class=\"ProductAwardVideo__awardVideoMoreContainer__hZyzH\"></ul></div> <!----></div> <div id=\"tabpanel-media\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"Media_review\"><div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__productAwardPagePadding__LFeX-\"><div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__line__Z71fT\" style=\"display:;\"></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__awardMediaTitle__t55HQ\"><h2 class=\"pageMedia vnRogFont ProductAwardMedia__vnRogFontSize__ARdRa\">\n        Media review\n      </h2> <span style=\"display:;\">(3)</span></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__mobileMediaContent__C6DyG\"><ul class=\"ProductAwardMedia__awardMediaContainer__M6cwI ProductAwardMedia__mediaItemLessThanThree__UaUrc\" style=\"width:100%;\"><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"unikoshardware\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1349/202008240959381860617.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      Overall, the ROG Astral LC RTX 5090 boasts meticulous craftsmanship and excellent performance. Its cool exterior and understated lighting evoke a blue galaxy design. Its top-tier cooling system reflects ROG's commitment to pushing boundaries in pursuit of ultimate performance. With a core temperature of 61.7°C and GDDR7 memory at 68°C during a 600W burn-in, it's easily the most powerful RTX 5090 currently available.\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      unikoshardware\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>TAIWAN</span> <span>03/28/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Thor 1000W Platinum III media of unikoshardware\" href=\"https://unikoshardware.com/2025/03/rog-astral-lc-rtx-5090-oc-review.html\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"e-zone\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1272/202010221106316330741.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      The ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 5080 continues the military-style design of the TUF series, featuring a rugged and durable appearance. The graphics card's casing is made from die-cast metal, providing additional structural strength to help prevent PCB bending and ensure long-term durability. For the backplate, ASUS uses a full-sized aluminum alloy backplate with ventilation openings to help dissipate heat from the back, improving overall cooling efficiency.\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      e-zone\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>HONG KONG</span> <span>01/30/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Thor 1000W Platinum III media of e-zone\" href=\"https://ezone.hk/article/20055454/asus-tuf-gaming-geforce-rtx-gb-gddr-oc-edition-%E8%A9%95%E6%B8%AC-%E9%A0%82%E5%B0%96%E6%95%88%E8%83%BD%E8%88%87%E8%80%90%E7%94%A8%E8%A8%AD%E8%A8%88%E7%9A%84%E7%B5%90%E5%90%88\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"www.hwupgrade.it\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1261/202205091652439070934.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      The ASUS PRIME RX 9060 XT OC offers excellent performance in 1440p with low power consumption, ideal for those on a medium budget. The ROG Strix 650W Gold is the perfect power supply for RX 9060/9070 systems, while the ROG THOR II 850W Platinum provides power and stability for more demanding GPUs. For those aiming for the top, the ROG Thor III 1000/1200W is the ultimate: efficiency, advanced technologies, and extreme performance.\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      www.hwupgrade.it\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>ITALY</span> <span>06/27/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Thor 1000W Platinum III media of www.hwupgrade.it\" href=\"https://www.hwupgrade.it/news/skvideo/radeon-rx-9000-tre-schede-video-per-il-grande-pubblico-quale-scegliere_140316.html\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li></ul></div> <!----></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__rewardMoreButton__7-dJ4\" style=\"display:none;\"><div class=\"seeAllButton__seeAllButton__dIrKX seeAllButton__visible__OJDnB\"><button tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Xem tất cả Media review\" class=\"robotoFont seeAllButton__text__TNQDv\"><span>\n      Xem tất cả\n    </span> <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" svg-inline alt role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M6 9.55l-5-5V2.5l5 5 5-5v2.05l-5 5z\" fill=\"#181818\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div> <script type=\"application/javascript\" src=\"https://rog.asus.com/rog/nuxtStatic/js/overview.js\"></script> <!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div> <!----> <!----></div></main>"}